      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَّاضَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain creeping insect</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُوَيْبَّة</span>) <i>that eats
wool.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And hence, app.,] (assumed tropical:)  <i>A man who
